  "draft_py": "# M20 Nightpack Ambusher\n# \"Other Wolves and Werewolves you control get +1/+1.\"  Pack Leader's lord static\n# (B4-modify-pt-other-dogs, \"Other Dogs you control get +1/+1.\") with the two creature types as\n# one FOr of SUBTYPE_EQ (Baneslayer's \"protection from Demons and from Dragons\" joins two\n# subtypes the same way). The end-step trigger is the compiler's (kept as it is).\nlord = StaticAbility(\n    effect=A(Verb.MODIFY_PT, {\n        'power': PtDelta(direction=PtDirection.INCREASE, magnitude=QConst(value=1)),\n        'target': Selector(\n            count=QUnbounded(),\n            mode=SelectorMode.ALL,\n            filter=FAnd(\n                children=(\n                    FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.CONTROLLER_IS, who=ControllerRef.YOU),\n                    FOr(\n                        children=(\n                            FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.SUBTYPE_EQ, string_value='Wolf'),\n                            FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.SUBTYPE_EQ, string_value='Werewolf'),\n                        ),\n                    ),\n                    FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n                    FNot(inner=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_SOURCE)),\n                ),\n            ),\n            zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n        ),\n        'toughness': PtDelta(direction=PtDirection.INCREASE, magnitude=QConst(value=1)),\n    }),\n)\nabilities = [lord, *compiled]\n",
